    <h2>Arté: Lumiere (2018)</h2>
    <a href="https://triseum.com/arte-lumiere/">https://triseum.com/arte-lumiere/</a>
    <p>
        <ul>
            <li>Created a node-based graphical dialogue editor that allowed for rapid implementation of dialogue trees
                <ul>
                    <li>Used reflection to populate fields in the Editor and to serialize the tree structure</li>
                    <li>Adjacency list to store the tree</li>
                    <li>Supported triggering actions from dialogue nodes</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Worked on a card-base minigame
                <ul>
                    <li>Rendering of flippable cards</li>
                    <li>Scoring of cards</li>
                    <li>Card snapping to zones</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Worked on a grid-based puzzle minigame
                <ul>
                    <li>Editor tool for quickly editing a grid of prefabs</li>
                    <li>Implementation of A* pathfinding</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </p>
